id: pm-lint-hsa6
title: Unblock the pm-github 2026.11.15 pin PR gates
description: ""
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-lint#86"
created_at: "2026-11-16T09:42:16.526Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-16T12:59:00.766Z"
author: pi-glm
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T09:42:37.745Z",pi-glm,"PR checks test (22) and test (26) fail in the 'npm release gates' step at changelog:check: the committed CHANGELOG.md was stale — the generator expected an '## Unreleased / No changes.' section before the 2026.11.14 entry (log: 'Changelog is out of date'). Root cause: the pin branch was cut before the changelog regeneration landed on main. Fix: merge origin/main (which already carries the regenerated CHANGELOG.md; changelog:check passes again on the merged tree) — no changelog hand-edit, the file comes from the repo's changelog script on main. No review threads on this PR. Because this tracker's changelog includes in_progress items, the changelog is regenerated with the repo script again after this item's changes so changelog:check stays green at the pushed head."
  "2026-11-16T12:07:10.258Z",codex-sol,"Codex continuation: preserved merge 6c4c5cf and the existing uncommitted tracker item. Rechecking both failed check logs and regenerating the changelog from tracker data; no duplicate item or PR. No review threads were returned."
  "2026-11-16T12:15:14.924Z",codex-sol,"Verified both failed jobs directly: 132764539585 log line 2115 and 132764539836 log line 955 report Changelog is out of date. Regenerated with npm run changelog:full after preserving the main merge and existing tracker item. Typecheck, lint, and linked exact caller-contract regression pass; quick npm tests are still running. No review threads were returned."
  "2026-11-16T12:28:54.314Z",codex-sol,"Prepared fix commit d9b06af: generated CHANGELOG.md now includes this existing in-progress pin item, with no manual changelog edits. npm run changelog:check passes at that commit; exact caller regression, typecheck, lint and tracker validation also pass. The broad quick suite has a timeout in the unchanged 10000-item incremental scale test (187736 ms against its 180000 ms harness deadline); final suite accounting remains pending. No limit or oracle is weakened."
  "2026-11-16T12:50:57.864Z",codex-sol,"Focused retry passes 1/1: PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 node --test --test-name-pattern=\"10000-item title edit\" test/incremental.test.ts. It took 204378 ms, exceeding the unchanged default 180000 ms harness deadline but fitting the existing scaled wrapper. It still seeds 10000 native items and asserts evaluated=30003, reused=49997; rebuild 83361 ms, update 9543 ms. This supports a shared-load harness timeout rather than a caller-pin functional regression. Broad suite accounting remains pending; no oracle or product budget changed."
  "2026-11-16T12:58:54.814Z",codex-sol,"Original Node 22/26 failures are stale generated changelog; fixed in d9b06af. Typecheck, lint, exact caller regression, changelog:check, identity gate and tracker validation pass. Focused 10000-item retry passes unchanged assertions with supported PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3. Full PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick npm test is still active at receipt preparation, with the already-recorded default-harness scale timeout; no complete-suite success is claimed. Leave this item in progress and release ownership for orchestrator verification."
